cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LKina in your research, please cite the manuscript and this software release."
title: "LKina: A Metal-Aware and Covalent-Reactive Molecular Docking Engine Extending AutoDock Vina"
abstract: >-
  LKina extends AutoDock Vina 1.2.7 with first-class metal coordination and
  reactive covalent docking: a 113-type AD4 atom system (80+ metals), an
  inline AutoGrid 4.2 reimplementation (no external autogrid4), four
  coordination pseudoatoms (TZ/SQ/MH/JT) with BVS oxidation-state inference,
  Jahn-Teller modes, a semi-explicit water-bridge model, reverse
  metal-donor pair potentials for metal-as-ligand workflows, and a four-tier
  reactive covalent framework (P1-P4) with explicit NAC detection, a C3
  two-phase search strategy, six reaction presets, and Metal Bias (O5).
